Cow Memory Hindsight image

This distribution is built from the Cow-owned fork of vectorize-io/hindsight.
Upstream source is licensed under the MIT License; the complete upstream license
is preserved in LICENSE. Cow-specific build policy and verification files are
also distributed under the repository's MIT License.

The exact upstream base, Cow commit, dependency SBOM, build provenance, target
platforms, and image digest are release artifacts. Third-party component
licenses are represented in the generated SPDX SBOM and must be reviewed before
an image digest is approved for deployment.
